        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7822, 1-5/8\" Beaded Cabinet Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's Round Beaded Cabinet Knob Rose is great for use with almost any cabinet knob or pull. (If using with a pull, you will need two rosettes per pull, one for each mount.) The beading design along the edge of this rose picks up the highlights of each of the available 7 finishes, giving the piece dimension. It has a 1-5/8 inch diameter. This beaded rosette will sure to add an extra layer of traditional fashion, in all of its beauty, to any space.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse with matching <a href=\"/products/plain-knob-with-beaded-edge-rk-international-ck-9310\"><b>Beaded Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7822 Beaded Single Hole Backplates:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/oil-bronze-crab.jpg?v=1704354545\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
